# skippedbook.
#
# OrbStack's include has to stay at the very top, before any Host block, or
# `ssh orb` and the Linux machines stop resolving - and OrbStack is what runs
# this machine's Kubernetes cluster.
#
# No IdentityAgent line here on purpose. 1Password is installed and its
# agent runs, but it prompts for approval on this machine's display for
# every request, and this machine is driven over SSH where nobody can
# answer that. The IdentityFile below is prompt-free.
#
# An earlier version pointed IdentityAgent at the socket before 1Password
# was installed at all, which made every outbound ssh fail with
# "Permission denied (publickey)".
Include ~/.orbstack/ssh/config

Host *
  AddKeysToAgent yes
  IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_backup
